      en: ["Desert experiences specifically designed for children.", "Located at the foot of the 150m high Erg Chebbi dunes.", "Focuses on nomadic culture and desert ecology.", "Guided stargazing sessions for young astronomers.", "Sandboarding equipment available for beginners.", "Educational tours through the nearby palm oases."],
